You need to have context about Customia.
The idea behind this is similar to Printify, users will login and have a personal store.
In their store they will be able to create products based on images, for example add images to a tshirt and put them on sale.
Other users/clientes will find the seller page and buy that product.
So sellers will have a:
- my store page: where they will be able to manage their store, sales and products (and more)
- the actual store: Where clientes will buy their products
Also users/clients are able to create a tshirt and buy it for themselves.